{"ref":"BDB, נְעַרְיָה","hw":"נְעַרְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְעַרְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a descendant of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.22\">1 Ch 3:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.23\">23</a>, 𝔊 Νωαδεια, 𝔊L Νεαριου.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Simeonite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.42\">1 Ch 4:42</a>; 𝔊 <em>id.</em>, 𝔊L Νααριας <strong>(</strong>cf. Sinait. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נערת</span> Cook<sup>82</sup><strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, נַעֲרָן","prev":"BDB, נַעֲרַי"}